---
---
<section class="py-20 px-6 relative z-10" id="csr">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-12 reveal">
      <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 mb-3 bg-csr-orange/10 text-csr-orange rounded-full text-xs font-bold">
        PROGRAM CSR KAMI
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-on-surface mb-2">Langkah Nyata untuk Lingkungan</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-outline max-w-md mx-auto">Kolaborasi aktif mahasiswa Ilmu Komunikasi UBSI dalam menciptakan budaya peduli lingkungan.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1 bg-white dark:bg-surface-container rounded-3xl p-6 border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-csr-orange/10 text-csr-orange flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">school</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-on-surface mb-2">Edukasi Sampah Era Digital</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Memberikan pengetahuan dasar mengenai pengurangan sampah dan penerapan 3R melalui media digital seperti Instagram dan TikTok.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/20 text-[11px] font-semibold text-csr-orange">
          Kampanye Digital Aktif
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2 bg-white dark:bg-surface-container rounded-3xl p-6 border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-csr-green/10 text-csr-green flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">diversity_3</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-on-surface mb-2">Seminar Edukasi Lingkungan</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Kegiatan seminar langsung untuk memperdalam pemahaman masyarakat dan siswa sekolah mengenai pengelolaan sampah dan 3R.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/20 text-[11px] font-semibold text-csr-green">
          Workshop & Interaksi Langsung
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-3 bg-white dark:bg-surface-container rounded-3xl p-6 border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">smart_toy</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-on-surface mb-2">Chatbot AI LISA</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Fasilitas digital yang dapat membantu masyarakat mendapatkan informasi praktis mengenai sampah, 3R, dan Bank Sampah selama 24 jam.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/20 text-[11px] font-semibold text-primary">
          Akses 24 Jam Nonstop
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
